  "vocabulary": {
    "cubby": "A Harbor execution slot that hosts a VM or fabric node. QVM Qnodes and Containership/DF slots are cubbies; mobile Bottle Rocket sessions are mobile cubbies in the same family. All cubbies are projected to the client browser on local 127 — never downloaded.",
    "mobile_cubby": "A cubby spawned when a mobile browser authenticates into Harbor (SPIRAL/ws-ticket). The Bottle Rocket VM runs inside the cubby on the Harbor gateway side and is projected to the device browser on local 127 — the device does not download the VM.",
    "cubby_materializer": "Reproducible compiler (brctl assemble + pins) that prepares/assembles the VM image for a cubby. Not a phone-storage download path.",
    "projection": "Browser-served view/session of the cubby VM via Harbor gateway on 127.0.0.1 (same-origin or ticketed path).",
    "sideload": "Optional advanced adb/idevice push of a staged package — demoted; not the enter-Harbor path.",
    "desktop_entry": "Desktop service requests via local 127 use cubby + browser projection directly for QVM and containership cubbies. No Bottle Rocket mobile cubby is required.",
    "mobile_entry": "Mobile browser login first creates a Bottle Rocket mobile cubby (MC-*). That cubby offloads/projects for lower device compute. Only after the BR mobile cubby is live may the mobile session attach to or create QVM/containership cubbies (proxied via the BR cubby).",
    "access_gate": "Gateway enforces mobile_br_cubby_required (403) when a mobile client targets QN-* or CS-* without a live MC-* for the principal. Desktop bypasses the BR prerequisite."
